flowchart TD
  S[Owned scene or explicit transient request] --> V{Media type}
  V --> T[Voice: validate language/script/target]
  T --> DG[Deepgram English]
  T --> EL[ElevenLabs Urdu]
  V --> I[Image: bounded prompt and owned target]
  I --> IP[Configured image provider]
  V --> M[Music: policy or intentional silence]
  M --> Score[Local CC0 sample score]
  DG --> Storage[Authenticated Storage upload]
  EL --> Storage
  IP --> Storage
  Score --> Storage
  Storage --> Assoc[Persist scene association]
  Assoc --> Preview[Synchronized preview]
